    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pxeb](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pxeb) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 106.829 depth occurred on Mar 07 2025 7km W of Cayarani. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -14.6711 longitude -72.081. It impacted 44763 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
